# This project is deployed onto a Linux SillyTavern install, so everything here
# must stay LF in the working tree as well as in the repo. Without this, Windows
# clients with core.autocrlf=true check files out as CRLF, which makes every
# deployed file differ from its local copy by every single line.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary / already-compressed formats: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
